"An Avowed's Privileges page lists special rights granted through the System."
"A commendation can grant a decorative design to embroider on Wardrobe clothes, like a medal."
"Authorized Witness is a privilege for certain System actions and legal contracts."
"Wizards or System kernels can grant privileges as gifts."
"A [MOTHER] privilege lets an Avowed's request pass from Earth's Contract to Contract I's Mother."
"It is a privilege for knights, for people who are owed; Mother decides whether to grant a request."
